      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "The warhead is the part that does the talking. It\u0027s a GregTech-built charge: a stainless steel casing around explosives and a fuze. A Tier 1 casing holds up to 5 charges, and more charges make a wider, harder blast.\n\nThe cheap starter recipe in the Assembler at HV makes a Condensed warhead with a fill of 1 from 2 stainless steel plates, 2 TNT and a Fuze Assembly Mk I. The full Condensed recipe (fill 5) takes 4 stainless plates, 8 TNT, 2 dynamite, 3 Plastic Explosive and a fuze. Every other Tier 1 blast type has its own Assembler recipe: check NEI and read the tooltips for radius and damage.\n\n[warn]A warhead is a live explosive block. Fire, redstone and nearby explosions all set it off.[/warn]",
